2:T106c,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","headline":"Sky Sports and TNT Sports on IPTV: What You Get","description":"Which sports channels an IPTV UK subscription carries: the full Sky Sports and TNT Sports line-up, Premier League coverage, cricket, F1 and PPV boxing — and what the same sport costs through Sky.","image":"https://iptvuk.buzz/images/guides/iptv-sky-sports.svg","dateModified":"2026-08-14","mainEntityOfPage":"https://iptvuk.buzz/iptv-sky-sports-uk","url":"https://iptvuk.buzz/iptv-sky-sports-uk","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"IPTV UK","url":"https://iptvuk.buzz","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://iptvuk.buzz/icon.svg"}},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"IPTV UK","url":"https://iptvuk.buzz","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://iptvuk.buzz/icon.svg"}}},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Does IPTV UK include Sky Sports?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — the complete Sky Sports line-up, including Main Event, Premier League, Football, Cricket, F1, Golf, Action, Arena, Sky Sports News, Racing, Mix and Sky Sports+. Main Event, Premier League and F1 are carried in 4K where Sky provides a 4K feed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I watch every Premier League match?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can watch the great majority of televised fixtures, because the line-up carries both Sky Sports and TNT Sports. But 267 of the 380 matches are broadcast live in the UK, and Saturday 3pm kick-offs are not shown domestically at all under the blackout rule. Any provider promising every match is describing something that does not exist in the UK."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is TNT Sports included?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, TNT Sports 1 to 4 plus TNT Sports Ultimate. That matters because TNT holds Champions League and Europa League football and Premiership rugby, none of which appear on Sky — a service carrying only one of the two packages leaves real gaps."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I pay extra for pay-per-view boxing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Sky Sports Box Office events are included on every plan rather than billed per event, which is where the difference against a conventional package is most visible — a single PPV night can cost more than a month of most plans here."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I watch sport in 4K?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, on the channels where the broadcaster provides a 4K feed — Sky Sports Main Event, Premier League and F1, and TNT Sports 1, 2 and Ultimate. You will want roughly 25 Mbps of steady broadband and a 4K television for it to be worth having."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What about cricket and Formula 1?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sky Sports Cricket carries England home Tests, ODIs and T20s along with The Hundred, county cricket and overseas tours. Sky Sports F1 carries every practice, qualifying session and race of the season plus F2 and F3."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Will it buffer during a big match?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Big fixtures put every service under load, which is exactly why the trial exists. Run it on a Saturday afternoon or a midweek European night rather than a quiet morning. A wired connection to the television is the single most effective thing you can do at your end."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the cost compare with Sky Sports through Sky?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Conventionally you need a base package, the Sky Sports add-on, a separate TNT subscription, often a 4K upgrade, and pay-per-view nights billed individually — usually on an 18 or 24-month contract. Plans here start at £14.99 with all of that included and no auto-renewal. The pricing page sets out the four options."}}]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://iptvuk.buzz"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Guides","item":"https://iptvuk.buzz/guides"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Sky Sports on IPTV UK","item":"https://iptvuk.buzz/iptv-sky-sports-uk"}]}]}6:["guideSlug","iptv-sky-sports-uk","d"]
